## Define Lakehouse build task-step contract

Context: Task 1 of the Lakehouse build-progress plan requires a backend-owned,
materialization-aware step contract so later pipeline execution and UI progress
rendering share one ordered source of truth.

Changes:

1. `tests/units/graphdb/delta/test_delta_build_pipeline.py`
   Added a parameterized contract test asserting the seven ordered step names
   and the mode-specific materialization description for `table` vs `view`.
2. `src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaTripleStoreBuildPipeline.py`
   Added `lakehouse_build_steps(materialization)` returning the exact seven-step
   backend contract with verbatim descriptions.
3. `src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py`
   Resolved Lakehouse materialization once in
   `start_databricks_triplestore_build` and delegated `tm.create_task(..., steps=...)`
   to the shared step factory.

